  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "1 tablespoon rum",
    "1 teaspoon ground nutmeg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Chill metal beaters for an electric mixer and a large metal bowl in the freezer for at least 5 minutes. Pour cream into chilled bowl and whip with electric mixer on high speed until cream is soft and fluffy, about 2 minutes. Slowly beat in sugar, whipping cream until it holds stiff peaks. Gradually beat in vanilla, rum, nutmeg; whipping cream to stiff peaks each time before adding next ingredient. Serve immediately.",
